WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.000
[Walking under tall trees beside Lake Te Koo Utu]

00:01:30.000 --> 00:03:00.000
[A wide gravel path through the trees and lawns]

00:03:00.000 --> 00:05:00.000
[Grassy lawn beside the lake, with weeping willows and water lilies]

00:05:00.000 --> 00:07:00.000
[Following the gravel path, then crossing a wooden bridge]

00:07:00.000 --> 00:09:00.000
[Walking on the grass along the edge of the lake. A mother duck and her ducklings are on the lawn]

00:09:00.000 --> 00:11:00.000
[Tree ferns and big trees beside the water]

00:11:00.000 --> 00:13:30.000
[The path goes under the trees, with the lake showing through the branches]

00:13:30.000 --> 00:16:25.000
[A gravel path through the park under tall trees to the end of the walk]
